    <briefdescription>
<para>This class tracks which instructions are in-flight (i.e., dispatched but not retired) in the OoO backend. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class checks on every cycle if/which instructions can be retired. Instructions are retired in program order. In the event of an instruction being retired, the pipeline that owns this <ref refid="structllvm_1_1mca_1_1_retire_control_unit" kindref="compound">RetireControlUnit</ref> (RCU) gets notified.</para>
<para>On instruction retired, register updates are all architecturally committed, and any physicall registers previously allocated for the retired instruction are freed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
